WEBVTT

00:00:06.007 --> 00:00:07.842
Wh-What's that?

00:00:08.050 --> 00:00:09.969
<i>N-No way'-!</i>

00:00:12.597 --> 00:00:13.639
Clouds?

00:00:13.848 --> 00:00:15.766
Is that a mirage?

00:00:51.552 --> 00:00:55.765
<i>This is me. My hair streams across...</i>

00:00:55.973 --> 00:01:00.353
<i>...my cheeks dyed red</i>

00:01:00.561 --> 00:01:04.523
<i>I am me... A grain of determination</i>

00:01:04.732 --> 00:01:09.278
<i>That was how it began</i>

00:01:09.487 --> 00:01:19.914
<i>If there is a tomorrow that is not
hazed over by hope or despair,</i>

00:01:20.122 --> 00:01:21.290
<i>(simple as that)</i>

00:01:21.499 --> 00:01:23.793
<i>I will not forget</i>

00:01:24.001 --> 00:01:29.340
<i>This pain is the promise we made that day</i>

00:01:29.548 --> 00:01:32.343
<i>I want to make it come true, I can't, I will</i>

00:01:32.551 --> 00:01:39.308
<i>At night I grab the void and awaken
to something in the morning</i>

00:01:39.517 --> 00:01:49.277
<i>I merely soar into the endless sky,
taking the shackles called "reason" Yes,</i>

00:01:49.485 --> 00:01:53.239
<i>"That is all.</i> "

00:02:03.291 --> 00:02:06.752
We've come to welcome you, my master.

00:02:06.961 --> 00:02:09.630
Please proceed.

00:02:16.304 --> 00:02:17.013
Let's go.

00:02:17.221 --> 00:02:20.224
It's fine. I won't let them do anything.

00:02:26.772 --> 00:02:28.024
I have to go.

00:02:28.232 --> 00:02:31.068
I need to see what Sakai-kun is doing.

00:02:31.277 --> 00:02:34.196
And if I can't accept it, then...

00:02:35.573 --> 00:02:37.408
If that happens...

00:02:39.660 --> 00:02:44.498
I'd like your help with
something, Yoshida-san.

00:02:44.707 --> 00:02:48.336
I'm just a human. It's something I can do?

00:02:48.544 --> 00:02:52.131
Something that only a human can do.

00:02:52.340 --> 00:02:54.216
Only a human who worked

00:02:54.425 --> 00:02:58.763
with the tuners to
repair the damage to this city.

00:03:00.181 --> 00:03:04.518
Don't worry. I won't let
the people here hurt you.

00:03:04.727 --> 00:03:06.562
I promise.

00:03:17.615 --> 00:03:23.579
Please add another few
hours to the millennia-long wait.

00:03:23.788 --> 00:03:28.501
Less than twelve. Tonight, at midnight.

00:03:31.587 --> 00:03:34.590
"Maelstrom of Conflict"

00:03:38.344 --> 00:03:40.888
To create the paradise Xanadu,

00:03:41.097 --> 00:03:43.349
we must open a large hole

00:03:43.557 --> 00:03:47.186
to the rift between worlds,
and send power through it.

00:03:49.063 --> 00:03:52.024
A large hole?

00:03:52.233 --> 00:03:55.653
The tuning involved repairing
the damage to Misaki City

00:03:55.861 --> 00:04:01.117
by restoring it to the image
that existed in your head,

00:04:01.325 --> 00:04:03.494
as someone born and raised here.

00:04:04.537 --> 00:04:06.038
We'll overwrite those repairs

00:04:06.247 --> 00:04:09.125
with an Unrestricted Method
called an Anti-Seal,

00:04:09.333 --> 00:04:13.170
and temporarily expand
the gaps that were repaired.

00:04:15.089 --> 00:04:16.715
When the gaps are expanded,

00:04:16.924 --> 00:04:20.177
things in this world will be
unable to connect to one another,

00:04:20.386 --> 00:04:22.680
and will essentially cease to exist.

00:04:22.888 --> 00:04:24.014
I guess you could describe it

00:04:24.223 --> 00:04:26.809
as a woven silk cloth
that suddenly has holes in it.

00:04:27.017 --> 00:04:28.436
And you'll send

00:04:28.644 --> 00:04:33.649
the huge power you need to make
the new world through those holes?

00:04:33.858 --> 00:04:35.151
Yes.

00:04:35.359 --> 00:04:38.779
This plan will relieve some of
the stress put on the Creator God.

00:04:38.988 --> 00:04:41.073
He quickly agreed to it.

00:04:42.158 --> 00:04:43.742
Plan?

00:04:43.951 --> 00:04:47.788
Then the reason you called
Ball Masque to Misaki City...

00:04:48.873 --> 00:04:51.083
Yes. I told you...

00:04:51.292 --> 00:04:54.128
This is Yuji Sakai's plan.

00:04:59.925 --> 00:05:01.343
Activate.

00:05:02.970 --> 00:05:05.097
The Crystal Altar?

00:05:06.223 --> 00:05:11.270
This shows the
places that you repaired.

00:05:12.813 --> 00:05:15.483
This is where I wanted to take you.

00:05:19.820 --> 00:05:21.280
And...

00:05:21.489 --> 00:05:23.616
This is the place I belong.

00:05:26.410 --> 00:05:27.745
BeLPeoL

00:05:27.953 --> 00:05:29.371
Yes.

00:05:35.878 --> 00:05:38.380
It will protect you.

00:05:38.589 --> 00:05:43.135
But we must seal
the power of that pendant.

00:05:43.344 --> 00:05:46.388
You can call her, right?

00:05:47.389 --> 00:05:52.102
I doubt summoning a single Crimson
Lord would accomplish much here,

00:05:52.311 --> 00:05:54.021
so it's just in case.

00:05:55.189 --> 00:05:58.234
Right now, l... l...

00:05:58.442 --> 00:06:03.072
Am I relieved that I lost
a chance to sacrifice my life?

00:06:03.280 --> 00:06:08.786
Sakai-kun would never miss
something that would let me resist...

00:06:09.954 --> 00:06:13.749
I closed my eyes to the
possibility that he would stop me,

00:06:13.958 --> 00:06:20.089
and gave myself over to the
excitement of seeing him again.

00:06:20.297 --> 00:06:24.426
In the end, I was even clinging
to the part of me that still

00:06:24.635 --> 00:06:26.720
cares for him.

00:06:26.929 --> 00:06:29.098
I have to think...

00:06:29.306 --> 00:06:31.600
About the reason I'm here.

00:06:31.809 --> 00:06:34.103
No... About its value.

00:06:35.896 --> 00:06:38.941
This is the central control room!

00:06:39.149 --> 00:06:41.360
I'd like to begin
the process of changing all

00:06:41.569 --> 00:06:45.531
the Palace of the Stars' functions
over to the True Ruler's Shrine.

00:06:45.739 --> 00:06:47.116
Is that all right?

00:06:47.324 --> 00:06:50.327
Of course it is. Begin.

00:06:50.536 --> 00:06:52.204
Roger that...

00:06:52.413 --> 00:06:54.582
Here we go!

00:06:54.790 --> 00:06:56.333
Domino!

00:06:56.542 --> 00:06:58.377
Yes, Professor, Sir!

00:06:58.586 --> 00:07:01.964
Activate the perfect
transformable alloy deluxe,

00:07:02.172 --> 00:07:03.757
the miracle of science,

00:07:03.966 --> 00:07:08.387
Excellent 252570, the Altar
Shrine of the Celebratory Ruler!

00:07:08.596 --> 00:07:10.014
Boop.

00:07:53.641 --> 00:07:55.476
This is it.

00:07:58.395 --> 00:08:00.397
Bel-Peol, finish this.

00:08:00.606 --> 00:08:02.024
Yes, Sir.

00:08:04.818 --> 00:08:06.654
Ta rtaros.

00:08:06.862 --> 00:08:09.239
Synchronize with the Seal.

00:08:19.083 --> 00:08:22.127
It is done, Master.

00:08:22.336 --> 00:08:23.462
Yes.

00:08:23.671 --> 00:08:26.965
Now no one inside
the seal will be devoured,

00:08:27.174 --> 00:08:31.512
regardless of how
violent the battle becomes.

00:08:31.720 --> 00:08:33.931
I see...

00:08:34.139 --> 00:08:38.394
Master, I would like
to begin preparations.

00:08:38.602 --> 00:08:39.687
Yes.

00:08:39.895 --> 00:08:42.690
Be sure they are prepared,
not only for war,

00:08:42.898 --> 00:08:44.900
but for chaos
and confusion, as well.

00:08:45.109 --> 00:08:46.527
Yes, Sir.

00:08:47.444 --> 00:08:50.906
Now then,
let us truly begin this time.

00:08:51.115 --> 00:08:54.201
My priestess,
here is my final declaration...

00:08:55.536 --> 00:08:56.954
Yes.

00:08:57.830 --> 00:09:02.751
Supreme Throne Hecate,
closest of those to you,

00:09:02.960 --> 00:09:07.631
raises her staff, Trigon, to open
a path to the minds of others.

00:09:21.895 --> 00:09:23.856
Look up and behold.

00:09:24.064 --> 00:09:25.274
I am divine.

00:09:25.482 --> 00:09:28.068
I am beyond your comprehension!

00:09:40.581 --> 00:09:45.794
As one of the leaders of this,
I'd like to say something as we finish.

00:09:46.003 --> 00:09:47.755
I am the God of Atonement.

00:09:47.963 --> 00:09:49.757
I judge their actions to be counter to

00:09:49.965 --> 00:09:52.509
the laws of the world, as I see
them in my knowledge and wisdom.

00:09:52.718 --> 00:09:55.637
And I will condemn and punish them.

00:09:55.846 --> 00:10:00.726
Thus, I believe this
operation to be the best option.

00:10:00.934 --> 00:10:04.938
I thank you for accompanying us.

00:10:05.147 --> 00:10:07.649
It's far too late for thanks.

00:10:07.858 --> 00:10:09.276
Words unnecessary.

00:10:09.485 --> 00:10:13.739
Right. No one
else will do it, so we will.

00:10:13.947 --> 00:10:16.825
With all our wit, and all our might.

00:10:17.034 --> 00:10:20.746
We shall weave
our plans, and win the victory.

00:10:26.084 --> 00:10:29.463
Then let us begin here, as well.

00:10:33.342 --> 00:10:36.178
That voice...
Is that you, Lamies-san?

00:10:36.386 --> 00:10:38.305
So, you were told my name.

00:10:38.514 --> 00:10:40.349
That is correct.

00:10:40.557 --> 00:10:42.309
It's been a long time.

00:10:42.518 --> 00:10:44.436
But Why?

00:10:44.645 --> 00:10:47.689
I volunteered for the
Anti-Seal's creation,

00:10:47.898 --> 00:10:51.026
as it would give me a
chance to speak to you again.

00:10:52.486 --> 00:10:57.491
This is the tuning mark that
Khamsin carved into the town.

00:11:03.872 --> 00:11:05.874
Activating Anti-Seal.

00:11:17.678 --> 00:11:19.972
Calm yourself.

00:11:22.850 --> 00:11:26.019
Nothing in reality is broken.

00:11:26.228 --> 00:11:29.857
I didn't expect it to
have such a violent effect.

00:11:30.065 --> 00:11:32.317
I apologize.

00:11:32.526 --> 00:11:33.944
No...

00:11:38.365 --> 00:11:40.909
Something feels wrong.

00:11:43.036 --> 00:11:46.748
I no longer feel at peace here.

00:11:46.957 --> 00:11:49.710
Does anything
feel wrong with your body?

00:11:49.918 --> 00:11:52.963
L-I'm all right. So now...

00:11:53.171 --> 00:11:56.466
Preparations for
the ceremony are complete.

00:11:56.675 --> 00:11:58.594
I see...

00:11:58.802 --> 00:12:00.596
Um, Lamies-san?

00:12:00.804 --> 00:12:03.098
Yes, Miss?

00:12:03.307 --> 00:12:07.060
Why are you helping Ball Masque?

00:12:07.269 --> 00:12:10.063
Is it because you
want to go to paradise?

00:12:11.607 --> 00:12:15.694
My reward is a portion of the
power of existence the Denizens

00:12:15.903 --> 00:12:18.113
will leave behind
on their way to paradise.

00:12:18.322 --> 00:12:22.951
I plan to fulfill my own desire

00:12:23.160 --> 00:12:26.455
through my work for Ball Masque.

00:12:31.043 --> 00:12:34.630
Yes, those are the
Denizens who seek paradise.

00:12:34.838 --> 00:12:35.797
This is Misaki City.

00:12:36.006 --> 00:12:36.632
Let's go.

00:12:36.840 --> 00:12:37.424
At midnight!

00:12:37.633 --> 00:12:39.009
Our paradise!

00:12:39.217 --> 00:12:41.053
We go to our paradise!

00:12:42.054 --> 00:12:45.474
"Misaki City"

00:12:45.474 --> 00:12:45.682
My, my... So many.

00:12:45.891 --> 00:12:47.768
I never thought Ball Masque would

00:12:47.976 --> 00:12:50.896
be nearly overwhelmed
by sheer numbers.

00:12:53.357 --> 00:12:54.983
It is as expected.

00:12:55.192 --> 00:12:58.278
But when seen,
it is almost terrifying.

00:13:00.989 --> 00:13:03.033
All proceed toward the Grand Order!

00:13:03.241 --> 00:13:06.286
Could there be any greater sight?

00:13:08.664 --> 00:13:12.334
Will you look at that?

00:13:12.542 --> 00:13:15.379
We've waited three
thousand years for this day.

00:13:15.587 --> 00:13:21.176
Yes. It will be a splendid
day for the living and the dead.

00:13:28.183 --> 00:13:31.436
This is nothing like three
thousand years ago.

00:13:31.645 --> 00:13:34.940
The cards we have,
the number of our fellows here...

00:13:35.148 --> 00:13:39.444
High Priestess, the time has come.

00:13:39.653 --> 00:13:41.571
Proceed to the throne.

00:13:42.906 --> 00:13:44.533
Very well.

00:13:47.536 --> 00:13:50.414
We will now proceed to the
third stage of the Grand Order,

00:13:50.622 --> 00:13:53.375
activating the Grand Order Psalms,

00:13:53.583 --> 00:13:56.169
and intoning the Ceremonial Prayer,

00:13:56.378 --> 00:13:58.839
to create the paradise Xanadu.

00:14:00.048 --> 00:14:03.260
Transferring back-up
functions to the Conloquium.

00:14:03.468 --> 00:14:05.303
Transfer confirmed.

00:14:24.239 --> 00:14:25.615
Farewell,

00:14:25.824 --> 00:14:29.619
my beloved Supreme Throne, Hecate.

00:14:30.871 --> 00:14:31.830
Yes.

00:14:32.039 --> 00:14:36.334
Let us meet again,
Thousand Changes Sydonay.

00:14:50.766 --> 00:14:52.642
It's not a shadow...

00:14:52.851 --> 00:14:56.521
It's a projection of existence,
cast inside the zone.

00:14:56.730 --> 00:14:58.148
It wavers because

00:14:58.356 --> 00:15:03.236
it has been chosen as the sacrifice
for the summoning of divine power.

00:15:03.445 --> 00:15:05.155
Sacrifice?

00:15:05.363 --> 00:15:08.200
That is the role of the Priestess.

00:15:08.408 --> 00:15:11.703
Of course, even if she is
annihilated as a sacrifice here,

00:15:11.912 --> 00:15:14.247
she will be reborn someday.

00:15:14.456 --> 00:15:18.376
After the Creator God's divine
power is summoned and grants a wish,

00:15:18.585 --> 00:15:21.213
it sleeps for a time
equivalent to the wish it grants.

00:15:21.421 --> 00:15:24.674
While the god sleeps,

00:15:24.883 --> 00:15:28.762
she will be reborn for
the granting of our next wish,

00:15:28.970 --> 00:15:31.431
awaiting the god's next awakening.

00:15:31.640 --> 00:15:35.102
Thus, she appears
when our wishes and prayers

00:15:35.310 --> 00:15:38.897
have grown strong
enough to call forth the god.

00:15:39.106 --> 00:15:42.109
She is the forerunner
of his next appearance.

00:15:42.317 --> 00:15:47.155
Therefore, she is treated with
the greatest respect.

00:15:56.414 --> 00:16:00.961
This time, he's making a whole world.

00:16:01.169 --> 00:16:04.714
How long it will be...

00:16:04.923 --> 00:16:07.634
She's accepting
a task she doesn't want.

00:16:07.843 --> 00:16:11.721
So why is her expression so resolute?

00:16:19.813 --> 00:16:22.107
Someone down there is different!

00:16:22.315 --> 00:16:23.733
A Flame Haze?

00:16:32.534 --> 00:16:34.536
This sky bores me.

00:16:38.165 --> 00:16:40.000
Come down.

00:16:46.006 --> 00:16:47.757
We are the stars...

00:16:47.966 --> 00:16:49.426
The singing stars.

00:16:49.634 --> 00:16:52.053
The stars who sing with dazzling light.

00:16:52.262 --> 00:16:55.348
We are the birds...
The birds who breathe flame.

00:16:55.557 --> 00:16:58.935
We fly the heavens as we will.

00:16:59.144 --> 00:17:02.022
Thus together, we birds and stars...

00:17:02.230 --> 00:17:05.317
...become a galaxy, dazzling and aflame.

00:17:07.235 --> 00:17:11.448
Damn it! So the first things they
sent were the Four Gods of Earth?

00:17:11.656 --> 00:17:14.326
I'd rather not have seen them again.

00:17:14.534 --> 00:17:16.620
But we cannot stop.

00:17:16.828 --> 00:17:18.246
Let's go.

00:17:18.788 --> 00:17:21.750
Right, right. Be sure to protect me.

00:17:22.876 --> 00:17:24.252
That's one of

00:17:24.461 --> 00:17:26.463
the Four Gods of the Earth?

00:17:27.172 --> 00:17:27.881
Flame Haze!

00:17:28.089 --> 00:17:30.175
It's too late for you!

00:17:30.383 --> 00:17:32.219
Take this!

00:17:44.773 --> 00:17:48.485
I was so scared...
You just attacked me.

00:17:56.201 --> 00:17:59.621
Stop fighting, and return
to the Crimson World!

00:17:59.829 --> 00:18:01.289
Please!

00:18:11.216 --> 00:18:12.634
Good...

00:18:16.346 --> 00:18:18.473
Let's do this, Leraje.

00:18:18.682 --> 00:18:21.601
We have no choice, do we?

00:18:39.119 --> 00:18:40.245
Devour more of them!

00:18:40.453 --> 00:18:41.955
Devour them,
and increase your numbers,

00:18:42.163 --> 00:18:44.541
my beautiful dead!

00:18:44.749 --> 00:18:48.211
Yes, yes! Today is a banquet!

00:18:48.420 --> 00:18:51.089
A banquet of blood and fire!

00:18:53.174 --> 00:18:54.801
Stop, men.

00:18:57.178 --> 00:19:01.933
I've heard tales of you from the
Bright Flame, General of Evil Spirits.

00:19:02.142 --> 00:19:03.935
Unlike us, He Who Walks with the Rain

00:19:04.144 --> 00:19:06.604
neither enjoyed
nor mastered the art of war.

00:19:06.813 --> 00:19:10.900
And yet, you hurt him.

00:19:11.109 --> 00:19:13.987
And in the end, you killed him.

00:19:14.195 --> 00:19:18.033
That victory was a gift
from the master and the General.

00:19:18.241 --> 00:19:21.786
I, myself, was defeated in that battle.

00:19:21.995 --> 00:19:25.665
Well, that's fine...

00:19:25.874 --> 00:19:30.045
If I kill, slaughter, murder,
and annihilate the evil spirits,

00:19:30.253 --> 00:19:33.381
then someday, I'll have my revenge.

00:19:33.590 --> 00:19:37.093
You have to get your fun in a war.

00:19:37.302 --> 00:19:41.556
Let's both give this everything we have!

00:19:41.765 --> 00:19:45.018
Very well. With all my weapons,

00:19:45.226 --> 00:19:47.145
and all I have.

00:19:49.606 --> 00:19:50.982
What?

00:19:57.864 --> 00:19:59.366
It's coming.

00:19:59.574 --> 00:20:01.409
<i>Go'.!</i>

00:20:02.869 --> 00:20:04.704
Shoot them down!

00:20:07.791 --> 00:20:09.542
We're going to search for
a line we can break through.

00:20:09.751 --> 00:20:12.003
Don't get shaken off until then!

00:20:17.258 --> 00:20:18.885
Take this!

00:20:25.058 --> 00:20:25.975
Leave this to me.

00:20:26.184 --> 00:20:28.019
Speedy breakthrough.

00:20:34.234 --> 00:20:36.236
We shall part here.

00:20:36.444 --> 00:20:37.737
Good luck.

00:20:37.946 --> 00:20:40.365
Right. See you later!

00:20:46.830 --> 00:20:47.747
Shana-chan!

00:20:47.956 --> 00:20:49.582
Kazumi!

00:21:05.181 --> 00:21:06.599
<i>Yum...</i>

00:21:07.809 --> 00:21:09.227
Shana“.

00:21:10.562 --> 00:21:12.564
--Let's finish this!
--Let's finish this!

00:21:13.398 --> 00:21:15.024
Shana-chan...

00:21:15.233 --> 00:21:16.860
Sakai-kun...

00:21:29.330 --> 00:21:31.833
Sakai-kun is doing this for Shana-chan.

00:21:32.041 --> 00:21:33.960
I'm sure of that.

00:21:34.169 --> 00:21:38.173
And Shana-chan is really
trying to defeat Sakai-kun.

00:21:39.424 --> 00:21:43.386
Both of them care about
the other more than anyone.

00:21:43.595 --> 00:21:47.599
So why... Why must they
do what the other doesn't want?

00:21:52.562 --> 00:21:53.480
Why?

00:21:53.646 --> 00:21:56.816
<i>The two footsteps, they head
toward the distant yonder</i>

00:21:57.025 --> 00:22:01.654
<i>The words I told you said,
"Let's leave everything behind"</i>

00:22:01.863 --> 00:22:06.993
<i>Fly toward the future</i>

00:22:07.202 --> 00:22:11.539
<i>The motive has a strong grasp on my
heart Yes, this is the ultimate descent</i>

00:22:11.748 --> 00:22:15.251
<i>The two of us are fellow soldiers
flattering one another's pulses</i>

00:22:15.460 --> 00:22:18.546
<i>If you are going to protect your love,
you cannot reject battle</i>

00:22:18.755 --> 00:22:22.300
<i>Without fudging a phrase,
we rhyme down this hot path</i>

00:22:22.509 --> 00:22:25.720
<i>Passing each other by, quarreling</i>

00:22:25.929 --> 00:22:29.349
<i>Set free from the enchantment</i>

00:22:29.557 --> 00:22:32.977
<i>If you are going to leave on a journey,</i>

00:22:33.186 --> 00:22:36.773
<i>I will never let go of your hand again</i>

00:22:36.981 --> 00:22:40.235
<i>Do you still remember the first time</i>

00:22:40.443 --> 00:22:43.947
<i>Our eyes locked, just as it happened?</i>

00:22:44.155 --> 00:22:47.242
<i>Even if I am engulfed
by the vortex of slumber,</i>

00:22:47.450 --> 00:22:53.122
<i>It will not vanish,
I won't let it-- It's our dream</i>

00:22:53.331 --> 00:22:54.499
<i>To be as ONE</i>

00:22:54.707 --> 00:22:59.379
<i>When you placed your hands on
your cheeks and laughed</i>

00:22:59.587 --> 00:23:01.756
<i>I thought, "I want to protect you"</i>

00:23:01.965 --> 00:23:05.718
<i>We took a roundabout path, huh?
But I've realized</i>

00:23:05.927 --> 00:23:09.430
<i>That I live just for you</i>

00:23:09.639 --> 00:23:12.976
<i>Snow of light flutters down the sky</i>

00:23:13.184 --> 00:23:16.771
<i>Where the waning
moon and stars go to snuggle</i>

00:23:16.980 --> 00:23:19.983
<i>The story we have written</i>

00:23:20.191 --> 00:23:24.487
<i>Will continue on forever</i>

00:23:25.989 --> 00:23:28.241
Shana and Yuji attack
each other with heart and soul.

00:23:28.449 --> 00:23:32.579
As she watches them, Yoshida's feelings
compel her to take up the Giralda.

00:23:32.787 --> 00:23:35.873
What does the wind
visit upon the battlefield?

00:23:36.082 --> 00:23:38.126
Next time,
on Shakugan no Shana Final:

00:23:38.334 --> 00:23:39.836
"What the Wind Calls."
